  "description": "Native is the third studio album by American pop rock band OneRepublic. It was released on March 22, 2013 through Mosley Music Group and Interscope Records in Germany and Ireland, March 25 worldwide except North America, and March 26 in North America. The album was originally planned to be released at the end of 2012 with the lead single being \"Feel Again\", which was released on August 27, 2012. However, due to the album not being completed at the time, it was pushed back to early 2013.",
